OL,3,GNEWSAFun day at site of iconic venue as
OL,4,Areopening looms
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn event is to take place at an iconic
OL,7,Fseafront venue in Kent for the first
OL,8,Ftime in four years.
OL,10,FMargate Winter Gardens, which has
OL,11,Fhosted both The Beatles and Laurel and
OL,12,FHardy, closed its doors in August 2022,
OL,13,Fwith its future uncertain.
OL,15,FPlans for a multi-million-pound
OL,16,Frenovation were approved in 2025, with
OL,17,Findoor events set to begin again in
OL,18,FMarch 2027.
OL,20,FThe free family fun day on is taking
OL,21,Fplace on Saturday and Sunday on the
OL,22,Fgreen outside the venue.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
